---
// Slim, full-bleed sitewide announcement banner tying the project to the
// Delaware State Parks 75th anniversary (system founded 1951; 2026 is the
// anniversary year, June the anniversary month). Renders at the very top of
// every page, above the sticky page-header. The whole bar is one link so it
// is an easy tap target; on the homepage it jumps to the #anniversary band,
// elsewhere it navigates home to it.
---

<aside class="site-banner" aria-label="Announcement">
  <a class="site-banner-link" href="/#anniversary">
    <span class="site-banner-badge" aria-hidden="true">75</span>
    <span class="site-banner-text">
      <strong>Delaware State Parks turns 75 in 2026.</strong>
      <span class="site-banner-sub">Fox Point is part of the story.</span>
    </span>
    <span class="site-banner-cta" aria-hidden="true">Read&nbsp;→</span>
  </a>
</aside>
